or flame, slice, and plating, and shape the music so the edit feels designed rather than simply backed."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"CONTINUITY","timestamp_seconds":9,"problem":"The transition from prep close-ups to the bite reaction feels abrupt and slightly disconnected from the premium craft story.","fix":"Insert a cleaner hero plating beat before the bite so the payoff feels earned and coherent."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"VISUAL_VARIETY","timestamp_seconds":4.5,"problem":"Several consecutive shots stay in similar close-up prep framing, creating visual sameness.","fix":"Reorder to alternate action, overhead, and hero framing more aggressively."}]
